From 59b736d6959366c623ae5ae673802465d7843c0b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yaegerbomb42 <yaeger.james42@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 15:26:01 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(vm): desktop VM image (Xvfb/VNC/Chromium/Claude Code)

Adds the swarmagents-vm-desktop image for the swarm VM platform: Debian
bookworm (node 22) with Xvfb :1 (1280x800x24), openbox + tint2 + feh
wallpaper, x11vnc on 127.0.0.1:5900, websockify/noVNC on 0.0.0.0:6080,
a persistent Chromium with remote debugging on 127.0.0.1:9222, the Claude
Code CLI, and a non-root agent user (uid 1000) owning HOME and /workspace.
The entrypoint runs a tiny supervisor that restarts any dead service.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
